#: core/templates/core/leadership/authority_chairman.html:425
msgid "Lead regional responses to security threats, including terrorism, insurgency, and cross-border criminal activities."
msgstr "Liderar as respostas regionais às ameaças à segurança, incluindo terrorismo, insuêrreicão e atividades criminosas transfronteiriças."

