#: core/templates/core/leadership/authority_chairman.html:438
msgid "Represent ECOWAS at international forums, building partnerships with global organizations and other regional blocs."
msgstr "Representar a CEDEAO em fóruns internacionais, construindo parcerias com organizações globais e outros blocos regionais."

