#: core/templates/core/leadership/authority_chairman.html:451
msgid "Advance initiatives to deepen economic cooperation, including the ECOWAS Single Currency and Common External Tariff."
msgstr "Promover iniciativas para aprofundar a cooperação econômica, incluindo a Moeda Única da CEDEAO e a Tarifa Externa Comum."

#: core/templates/core/leadership/authority_chairman.html:462
