msgstr "Unidade Regional"

#: core/templates/core/leadership/authority_chairman.html:464
msgid "Foster unity among member states, mediating disputes and promoting collaborative solutions to shared challenges."
msgstr "Promover a unidade entre os estados membros, mediando disputas e promovendo soluções colaborativas para os desafios comuns."

#: core/templates/core/leadership/authority_chairman.html:477
